  "description": "IMIGAN crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n a 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C44 H72 O22 Sm4,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.686-4.033 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.89-113.30°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C46H74O24Sm4.",
  "interpretation_limit": "Oxidation states, nuclearity, oxo/hydroxo bridging, core charge and ligand identities/counts require article/SI or manual verification; atom-site counts are asymmetric-unit counts, not molecular stoichiometry. Graph topology is limited to identity-symmetry bonds in the CIF table. Approximate shape is based only on bridge-unwrapped metal-site coordinates in the largest component; symmetry-related bonds or periodic structures require manual crystallographic review. Empirical formulas alone do not establish unique oxidation-state assignments or ligand connectivity; annotations above reproduce explicit structural notation only.",
